      <p>Most guests drive from Kansas City, St. Louis, Columbia, and elsewhere in Missouri, along with Kansas, Illinois, Iowa, and Arkansas. Groups of friends, extended families, bachelor and bachelorette parties, and boating enthusiasts are common. Weekend travelers dominate, and holiday weekends such as Memorial Day, Fourth of July, and Labor Day are especially busy. Motorcycle and other event weekends bring their own groups. Because the lake has a reputation for social boating, some guests prioritize party-friendly homes, while families look for calmer coves.</p>

